        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG104/204/4850 Contemporary Square Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Stainless Steel Entry Lever Set with Square Deadbolt features the new contemporary style Square Rose combined with a high security single cylinder square deadbolt. For entry doors that require security locking. All stainless steel exterior components. The very crisp corners on the square roses put AHI above its competitors. Available in satin or polished stainless steel finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other functions: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-sapporo-lever-with-square-rose-ahi-sig104-204\"><b>AHI SIG104/204 Square Rose Stainless Levers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All the exterior components, including the latch, screws and strike plates are stainless steel.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable faceplate / armor plate for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for replacement installations.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Screw Square Rose: 2-1/2\" Square with 1/2\" projection. Self aligning spring assisted. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-sapporo-lever-with-square-rose-ahi-sig104-204\">AHI SIG104/204 Square Rose Stainless Levers</a>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5.35\" (136 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.44\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 0.87\" (22 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-1/2\" (63 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Commercial and Residential use.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-high-security-square-single-cylinder-deadbolt-ahi-4850\">AHI  4850 Square Stainless Steel Deadbolt</a>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Housing Size: 2-1/2” Square</li> \r\n<li>Outside Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Thumbturn Projection: 15/16” Overall</li> \r\n<li>Available in 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Schlage “C” keyway</li>\r\n<li>High Security 1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
